<title>LATVIA: RIETUMU BANK BOOSTS SHARE CAPITAL.</title>
<headline>RIETUMU BANK BOOSTS SHARE CAPITAL.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rietumu Bank said on Thursday that it has increased its share capital to 9.1 million lats from 4.5 million lats, using its 1996 profit.</p>
<p>The bank said it was now the fourth largest bank in Latvia in terms of assets and one of the top 10 banks in the Baltic states.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
